The first two files below are copied unchanged from commit snapshots of two WHATWG standards;
the third holds the blocks of Web IDL of a commit snapshot of a third, not the page. The crate
surf-webidl reads the Web IDL of the first two from their section "IDL Index": the text content
of the pre element after the h2 element whose id is idl-index. Of the HTML Standard, a single
page without such an index, it reads only the pre blocks of class idl that define Window or a
partial Document, and of them only the members crates/webidl/selection.txt names
(story:webidl-bindings, decision 7).

